<title>LATVIA: SOCCER-BELARUS BEAT LATVIA 3-0 IN U-21 EURO QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BELARUS BEAT LATVIA 3-0 IN U-21 EURO QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>VALMIERA, Latvia 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvia lost 0-3 to Belarus (halftime 0-1) in a European under-21 soccer championship group four qualifier on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Scorers: Maksim Romashenko 32 pen, 83, Maksim Razumov 80</p>
<p>Attendace: 550</p>
